  "description": "The functional preprocessing pipeline will be run with the default HCP parameters: the resting\u2011state fMRI series is identified as **rfMRI_REST**, bias correction is set to **NONE**, and motion correction will be performed with **MCFLIRT**. Anatomical registration will use **6 degrees of freedom**, and no additional registration name is specified (the field is left **Empty**).\n\nAll required inputs have been provided. The structural data are supplied as a **ZIP** archive, while the functional time\u2011series, the scout image, the positive and negative spin\u2011echo field maps, and both the Siemens GRE magnitude and phase images are all in **NIfTI** format. Gradient coefficients are included (no specific file type is needed), and a valid **FreeSurfer license** file is also attached.",
